    <h1 class="title">Professional Technology Services</h1>
    
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 3rem auto; text-align: center; color: var(--text-color); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">RCDEV LLC designs, develops, and manages modern digital solutions for businesses that need reliable websites, custom software, cloud infrastructure, automation, and ongoing technical support.</p>
        <p>Our services combine software engineering, cloud technologies, security best practices, and managed support to deliver scalable solutions built around each client's operational needs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rc-services-grid">
        
        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">🌐</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">Custom Web Applications</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Design and development of secure, responsive, and scalable web applications tailored to business workflows and customer experiences. Solutions may include customer portals, internal dashboards, administrative systems, scheduling platforms, data-driven applications, and modern business websites. Applications are built using modern development frameworks and structured for maintainability, performance, security, and future growth.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">ASP.NET Core</span><span class="rc-tag">Blazor</span><span class="rc-tag">React</span><span class="rc-tag">C#</span><span class="rc-tag">JavaScript</span><span class="rc-tag">REST APIs</span><span class="rc-tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="rc-tag">Docker</span><span class="rc-tag">CI/CD</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">💻</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">Business Websites &amp; Digital Platforms</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Professional websites designed for businesses that need more than a basic online presence. RCDEV builds responsive, performance-focused websites with modern layouts, lead-generation capabilities, analytics, technical SEO foundations, secure forms, and managed deployment. Available solutions range from informational business websites to advanced digital platforms requiring custom functionality and third-party integrations.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">Responsive Design</span><span class="rc-tag">Lead Generation</span><span class="rc-tag">Technical SEO</span><span class="rc-tag">Analytics</span><span class="rc-tag">CMS Integration</span><span class="rc-tag">Secure Forms</span><span class="rc-tag">Custom Development</span><span class="rc-tag">Managed Hosting</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">🤖</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">AI, Automation &amp; Intelligent Systems</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Integration of artificial intelligence and workflow automation into business applications and operational processes. RCDEV can develop solutions that use large language models, semantic search, document processing, intelligent assistants, and automated workflows to reduce repetitive work and improve access to business information. Solutions may incorporate commercial AI platforms or appropriately selected open-source technologies depending on project requirements.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">OpenAI APIs</span><span class="rc-tag">Anthropic APIs</span><span class="rc-tag">RAG</span><span class="rc-tag">Semantic Search</span><span class="rc-tag">Vector Databases</span><span class="rc-tag">Intelligent Document Processing</span><span class="rc-tag">C#</span><span class="rc-tag">Python</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">⚡</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">API &amp; Systems Integration</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Development of secure APIs and integration layers that allow websites, applications, databases, mobile systems, and third-party services to communicate reliably. RCDEV designs API architectures with authentication, authorization, rate limiting, documentation, validation, caching, and structured error handling. Integration projects can connect existing business systems, external platforms, payment providers, cloud services, or custom applications.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">REST</span><span class="rc-tag">GraphQL</span><span class="rc-tag">OAuth 2.0</span><span class="rc-tag">OpenID Connect</span><span class="rc-tag">OpenAPI / Swagger</span><span class="rc-tag">Redis</span><span class="rc-tag">PostgreSQL</span><span class="rc-tag">Webhooks</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">☁️</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">Cloud Infrastructure &amp; Deployment</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Design, deployment, and management of cloud infrastructure for websites and custom applications. RCDEV works with modern cloud platforms to configure secure hosting environments, databases, networking, storage, backups, SSL/TLS, application deployment, monitoring, and supporting infrastructure. Architectures are selected according to application requirements, reliability targets, security considerations, expected usage, and operating cost.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">AWS</span><span class="rc-tag">Microsoft Azure</span><span class="rc-tag">Google Cloud</span><span class="rc-tag">Cloudflare</span><span class="rc-tag">Docker</span><span class="rc-tag">Linux</span><span class="rc-tag">Terraform</span><span class="rc-tag">SSL/TLS</span><span class="rc-tag">Load Balancing</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">🚀</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">CI/CD &amp; Deployment Automation</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Implementation of automated development and deployment pipelines that improve reliability and reduce manual deployment processes. RCDEV can configure automated builds, testing, deployment workflows, environment management, infrastructure provisioning, and release processes. These systems help maintain consistent deployments across development, staging, and production environments.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">GitHub Actions</span><span class="rc-tag">CI/CD</span><span class="rc-tag">Infrastructure as Code</span><span class="rc-tag">Terraform</span><span class="rc-tag">Docker</span><span class="rc-tag">Automated Testing</span><span class="rc-tag">Deployment Pipelines</span><span class="rc-tag">Environment Management</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rc-service-card rc-glass hud-brackets">
            <div class="rc-service-header">
                <span class="rc-service-icon">🔧</span>
                <div class="rc-service-title">Managed Infrastructure &amp; Application Support</div>
            </div>
            <p class="rc-service-desc">Ongoing technical management for websites, cloud infrastructure, and custom applications. Managed services can include infrastructure administration, application monitoring, backups, security updates, dependency maintenance, troubleshooting, deployment support, and defined minor modifications. The objective is to keep production systems stable, secure, monitored, and properly maintained after launch.</p>
            <div class="rc-tags">
                <span class="rc-tag">Application Monitoring</span><span class="rc-tag">Cloud Administration</span><span class="rc-tag">Backups</span><span class="rc-tag">Security Updates</span><span class="rc-tag">Dependency Management</span><span class="rc-tag">Deployment Support</span><span class="rc-tag">Linux Administration</span><span class="rc-tag">Troubleshooting</span>
