            <p class="rc-service-desc">Custom software and digital infrastructure for healthcare organizations requiring secure, structured, and workflow-driven applications. RCDEV can develop systems involving patient management, scheduling, provider workflows, administrative portals, secure forms, document management, reporting, role-based access, and integrations. Solutions can be architected to support applicable healthcare security and compliance requirements based on the project's specific scope and infrastructure requirements.</p>
